# Entes EMM-04S/EMM-04CS.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | ENTES EMM-04S / EMM-04CS 3-Phase Power Analyzer (Modbus RTU RS-485)
# | 
# | Source: entes-emm-series-modbus-register-map-en.pdf
# | Models: EMM-04S (basic), EMM-04CS (with I/O module: digital I/O, relays, pulse inputs)
# | Protocol: Modbus RTU, FC03 read holding registers; FC06/16 write
# | Baud: configurable (reg 17358); default 9600 8N1
# | Float measurements: f32 (2 consecutive registers, IEEE 754)
# | Integer config/counters: u32 (2 words) unless noted as s16 (1 word)
# | Pulse counters, relay coil controls, and alarm dynamic registers: see datasheet
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Entes
@model=EMM-04S/EMM-04CS
@description=3-phase power analyzer, Modbus RTU. FC03 read. Float (f32) measurements at addr 0-146: phase/line voltages, currents, frequency, active/reactive/apparent power (per-phase + totals + quadrants), power factor, cos-phi, voltage/current angles, internal temp. Counters: hour meter (128), working hours (130), pulse 1-8 (132-146). Min/Max/Demand at 800-1335 (516 regs, see datasheet). Alarm status u32 at 20000/20002 (EMM-04CS). Network settings R at 16384; setup R/W at 17000 (CT/VT ratios, network type, demand time, alarm thresholds, pulse I/O); Modbus comms at 17354. Device ID at 60416.
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/entes-emm-series.toml; Source: entes-emm-series-modbus-register-map-en.pdf. Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

